english translation text:
My complaint is to you, and my grievance is also to you;
I cannot speak every matter to anyone else.
Call me to your shrine at least once, my Master;
my heart is filled with grief, and I wish to come and tell you.

O Gate of Needs, by Mohsin's oath;
Abbas, by the oath of the infant Asghar;
grant me at least the charity of Aun and Muhammad.
My heart is filled with grief, and I wish to come and tell you.
